==English==

===Noun===
{{en-noun|head=[[second]] [[banana]]}}

# {{idiomatic}} A [[comedian]] who plays a [[secondary]] or [[supporting]] role, especially as [[straight man]] and traditionally in [[vaudeville]] or [[burlesque]] [[theatre]].
#: ''He grew disenchanted with playing '''second banana''' and never getting credit for the laughter.''
# {{idiomatic}} A person who serves in a supporting, secondary, or [[subsidiary]] capacity; an [[assistant]].
#: ''The plumber left his '''second banana''' behind, to finish installing my new sink.''
#* '''2012''', Michael Smyth, "[http://www.theprovince.com/lifeboat+filling/7166222/story.html The lifeboat is filling up]", ''The Province'', 30 August 2012:
#*: When you want to be the boss, but you can't, it's not a lot of fun to be '''second banana'''.

